<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Waiting For Superman"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Chris Daughtry"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Waiting For Superman"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="27731241"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="42886855"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ArSrNa"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Chris Daughtry</songwriter><songwriter>Martin Johnson</songwriter><songwriter>Sam Hollander</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:09.816"><div begin="5.509" end="4:09.816"><p begin="5.509" end="10.456" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.509" end="5.612">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="5.612" end="6.415">watching</span> <span begin="6.415" end="6.665">the</span> <span begin="6.665" end="7.673">taxi</span> <span begin="7.673" end="8.763">driver,</span> <span begin="8.763" end="9.008">he</span> <span begin="9.008" end="9.468">pulls</span> <span begin="9.468" end="10.456">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她看著计程车司机开了车门</span></p><p begin="12.325" end="19.895" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.325" end="12.807">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="12.807" end="13.687">been</span> <span begin="14.570" end="15.046">locked</span> <span begin="15.046" end="15.561">up</span> <span begin="15.561" end="16.149">inside</span> <span begin="16.149" end="16.753">her</span> <span begin="16.753" end="17.682">apartment</span> <span begin="17.682" end="18.078">a</span> <span begin="18.078" end="18.587">hundred</span> <span begin="18.587" end="19.895">days</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她要把自己深锁在她的公寓裡一百天</span></p><p begin="21.382" end="26.699" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.382" end="21.863">She</span> <span begin="21.863" end="22.909">says,</span> <span begin="23.096" end="23.313">“Yeah,</span> <span begin="23.313" end="23.646">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="23.646" end="23.953">still</span> <span begin="23.953" end="24.493">coming,</span> <span begin="24.493" end="24.737">just</span> <span begin="24.737" end="24.995">a</span> <span begin="24.995" end="25.590">little</span> <span begin="25.590" end="26.128">bit</span> <span begin="26.128" end="26.699">late</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她说：「是的，他一定会来的，只是有点晚</span></p><p begin="26.699" end="30.999" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.699" end="26.989">He</span> <span begin="26.989" end="27.282">got</span> <span begin="27.282" end="27.552">stuck</span> <span begin="27.552" end="27.825">at</span> <span begin="27.825" end="28.102">the</span> <span begin="28.102" end="28.364">laun</span><span begin="28.364" end="28.615">dro</span><span begin="28.615" end="29.112">mat</span> <span begin="29.239" end="29.915">washing</span> <span begin="29.915" end="30.395">his</span> <span begin="30.395" end="30.999">cape”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他在洗衣店洗他的披风时遇到了麻烦」</span></p><p begin="30.999" end="39.644" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.999" end="31.432">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="31.432" end="32.171">just</span> <span begin="32.827" end="33.538">watching</span> <span begin="33.538" end="33.808">the</span> <span begin="33.808" end="34.394">clouds</span> <span begin="34.394" end="34.922">roll</span> <span begin="34.922" end="35.453">by</span> <span begin="35.453" end="35.756">and</span> <span begin="35.756" end="36.051">they</span> <span begin="36.051" end="36.323">spell</span> <span begin="36.323" end="36.690">her</span> <span begin="36.690" end="37.513">name</span> <span begin="38.144" end="38.378">like</span> <span begin="38.378" end="38.761">Lois</span> <span begin="38.761" end="39.644">Lane</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她只是看着云朵滚滚而过，它们把她的名字拼得像露易丝·莱恩(超人的女主角)</span></p><p begin="39.644" end="46.081" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.644" end="40.027">And</span> <span begin="40.027" end="40.458">she</span> <span begin="40.458" end="41.498">smiles,</span> <span begin="42.809" end="43.768">oh</span> <span begin="43.768" end="44.061">the</span> <span begin="44.061" end="44.578">way</span> <span begin="44.578" end="45.022">she</span> <span begin="45.022" end="46.081">smiles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而她笑著，哦~她笑著的样子...</span></p><p begin="48.565" end="52.857" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.565" end="48.800">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="48.800" end="49.427">talking</span> <span begin="49.427" end="49.697">to</span> <span begin="49.697" end="50.164">an</span><span begin="50.164" end="51.074">gels,</span> <span begin="51.074" end="51.354">coun</span><span begin="51.354" end="51.641">ting</span> <span begin="51.641" end="51.908">the</span> <span begin="51.908" end="52.857">stars</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她倾诉於天使，细数著星星</span></p><p begin="53.311" end="57.364" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.311" end="53.909">Making</span> <span begin="53.909" end="54.196">a</span> <span begin="54.196" end="54.711">wish</span> <span begin="54.711" end="54.891">on</span> <span begin="54.891" end="55.303">a</span> <span begin="55.303" end="56.304">passing</span> <span begin="56.304" end="57.364">car</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">向一台路过的车子许下愿望</span></p><p begin="57.604" end="1:02.266" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.604" end="57.930">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="57.930" end="58.480">dancing</span> <span begin="58.480" end="58.757">with</span> <span begin="58.757" end="1:00.092">strangers,</span> <span begin="1:00.092" end="1:00.685">falling</span> <span begin="1:00.685" end="1:02.266">apart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她与陌生人共舞，然而却崩溃了</span></p><p begin="1:02.266" end="1:06.775" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.266" end="1:02.888">Waiting</span> <span begin="1:02.888" end="1:03.189">for</span> <span begin="1:03.189" end="1:04.397">Superman</span> <span begin="1:04.397" end="1:04.651">to</span> <span begin="1:04.651" end="1:05.198">pick</span> <span begin="1:05.198" end="1:05.545">her</span> <span begin="1:05.545" end="1:06.775">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">等著超人来迎接她走</span></p><p begin="1:06.966" end="1:11.810" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.966" end="1:07.211">In</span> <span begin="1:07.211" end="1:07.971">his</span> <span begin="1:07.971" end="1:11.810">arms,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在他的怀裡</span></p><p begin="1:16.065" end="1:20.737" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.065" end="1:16.249">In</span> <span begin="1:16.249" end="1:17.101">his</span> <span begin="1:17.101" end="1:20.737">arms</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在他的怀裡</span></p><p begin="1:23.802" end="1:25.974" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.802" end="1:24.476">Waiting</span> <span begin="1:24.476" end="1:24.743">for</span> <span begin="1:24.743" end="1:25.974">Superman</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">等待著超人</span></p><p begin="1:27.112" end="1:31.864" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.112" end="1:27.292">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:27.292" end="1:27.615">out</span> <span begin="1:27.615" end="1:27.893">on</span> <span begin="1:27.893" end="1:28.177">the</span> <span begin="1:28.177" end="1:29.207">corner</span> <span begin="1:29.207" end="1:30.151">trying</span> <span begin="1:30.151" end="1:30.449">to</span> <span begin="1:30.449" end="1:30.692">catch</span> <span begin="1:30.692" end="1:30.952">a</span> <span begin="1:30.952" end="1:31.864">glimpse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她走出了角落试著去寻找那一瞬间</span></p><p begin="1:32.138" end="1:33.938" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.138" end="1:32.374">Nothing&apos;</span><span begin="1:32.374" end="1:32.636">s</span> <span begin="1:32.636" end="1:33.090">making</span> <span begin="1:33.090" end="1:33.938">sense</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却没有任何感动的事物</span></p><p begin="1:33.938" end="1:38.067" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.938" end="1:34.326">She&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:34.326" end="1:35.095">been</span> <span begin="1:36.166" end="1:36.683">chasing</span> <span begin="1:36.683" end="1:37.164">an</span> <span begin="1:37.164" end="1:38.067">answer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她致力追寻的答案</span></p><p begin="1:38.067" end="1:42.916" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.067" end="1:38.335">A</span> <span begin="1:38.335" end="1:38.851">sign</span> <span begin="1:38.851" end="1:39.164">lost</span> <span begin="1:39.164" end="1:39.457">in</span> <span begin="1:39.457" end="1:40.050">the</span> <span begin="1:40.050" end="1:40.872">abyss,</span> <span begin="1:41.191" end="1:41.464">this</span> <span begin="1:41.464" end="1:42.916">Metropolis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而那符号却迷失在这座大城市的深渊</span></p><p begin="1:42.916" end="1:48.219" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.916" end="1:43.432">She</span> <span begin="1:43.432" end="1:44.354">says...</span><span begin="1:44.600" end="1:44.854">“Yeah,</span> <span begin="1:44.854" end="1:45.077">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:45.077" end="1:45.338">still</span> <span begin="1:45.338" end="1:45.976">coming,</span> <span begin="1:45.976" end="1:46.221">just</span> <span begin="1:46.221" end="1:46.505">a</span> <span begin="1:46.505" end="1:47.039">little</span> <span begin="1:47.039" end="1:47.625">bit</span> <span begin="1:47.625" end="1:48.219">late</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他说：「是的，他一定会来的，只是有点晚</span></p><p begin="1:48.219" end="1:52.476" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.219" end="1:48.518">He</span> <span begin="1:48.518" end="1:48.841">got</span> <span begin="1:48.841" end="1:49.129">stuck</span> <span begin="1:49.129" end="1:49.415">at</span> <span begin="1:49.415" end="1:49.695">the</span> <span begin="1:49.695" end="1:49.978">Five</span> <span begin="1:49.978" end="1:50.270">and</span> <span begin="1:50.270" end="1:50.781">Dime</span> <span begin="1:50.781" end="1:51.347">saving</span> <span begin="1:51.347" end="1:51.799">the</span> <span begin="1:51.799" end="1:52.476">day”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他因為那五毛钱卡在洗衣店而耽误了一整天」</span></p><p begin="1:52.476" end="1:58.888" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.476" end="1:52.990">She</span> <span begin="1:52.990" end="1:53.849">says...</span><span begin="1:54.207" end="1:54.516">“If</span> <span begin="1:54.516" end="1:54.787">life</span> <span begin="1:54.787" end="1:55.077">was</span> <span begin="1:55.077" end="1:55.368">a</span> <span begin="1:55.368" end="1:56.132">movie,</span> <span begin="1:56.132" end="1:56.421">then</span> <span begin="1:56.421" end="1:56.826">it</span> <span begin="1:56.826" end="1:57.568">wouldn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:57.568" end="1:57.854">end</span> <span begin="1:57.854" end="1:58.128">like</span> <span begin="1:58.128" end="1:58.888">this”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她说：「如果生命像一部电影，那结局不应该像这样子结束」</span></p><p begin="1:59.251" end="2:01.033" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.251" end="1:59.534">Left</span> <span begin="1:59.534" end="1:59.827">wi</span><span begin="1:59.827" end="2:00.156">thout</span> <span begin="2:00.156" end="2:00.387">a</span> <span begin="2:00.387" end="2:01.033">kiss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连一个吻都没有留下</span></p><p begin="2:01.033" end="2:10.042" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agen